# the data home when it is this directory: scans, runs, users, the database
bench/*/*.pdf
!bench/real-*/*.pdf
bench/*/detect/
# derived benches: `datasets synth` redraws these from their seed,
# `datasets subset` rebuilds hard from the others. Only truth that
# nothing in the tree can regenerate is tracked.
